=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play runall/hardened -----------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the real$
# plan/apply engine against a simulated host, hostfake's$
# recording host.System, whose commands a model of the host$
# answers. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's, and its record is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: runall/hardened$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. Everything already as$
# hardn.yml asks: root login off, ufw on, the nameservers set,$
# updates on. sshPort 2230, as sshd has it.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
  Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Already as asked$
   -  SSH Login            Already as asked$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  Firewall             Already as asked$
   -  DNS                  Already as asked$
   -  Auto Updates         Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Nothing to change$
                           [-] Unavailable$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]: 0$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

